      "content": "serotonin syndrome sounds really scary, but honestly i've read online that it's super rare and only happens with huge doses. im just taking a normal dose of the syrup to stop the coughing so i can rest. if i just take a half dose or stay really hydrated, isn't that basically fine? i really dont want to spend my night in the er over a cough.",
